{"strongs": "H6005", "word": "עִמָּנוּאֵל", "translit": "im.ma.nu.el", "root": "עמנואל", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Immanuel", "definition": "עִמָּנוּאֵל proper name, masculine Immanuel ( with us is God ); — ׳ י Isa 7:14 van d. H. Baer ; עִמָּנוּ אֵל Gi ; — name of child, symbolizing presence of ׳ י to deliver his people (on interpret. see Commentaries) — עִמָּנוּ אֵל Isa 8:8 ; Isa 8:10 is declaration of trust and confidence, with us is God ! (compare Ps 46:8 ; Ps 46:12 ); see עִם .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6146')\">BDB6146</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6005')\">H6005</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H410')\">H410</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H5973')\">H5973</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6145')\">BDB6145</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6147')\">BDB6147</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עִמָּנוּאֵל</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <highlightword>Immanuel</highlightword> (<highlight>with us is God</highlight>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 7:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,14)\">Isa 7:14</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup>; <bdbheb>עִמָּנוּ אֵל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Gi</lookup>; — name of child, symbolizing presence of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> to deliver his people (on interpret. see Commentaries) — <bdbheb>עִמָּנוּ אֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,8)\">Isa 8:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 8:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,10)\">Isa 8:10</ref> is declaration of trust and confidence, <highlight>with us is God !</highlight> (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 46:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,46,8)\">Ps 46:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 46:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,46,12)\">Ps 46:12</ref>); see  <bdbheb><reflink>עִם</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 7:14", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Isa 8:8", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Isa 8:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ps 46:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 46, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ps 46:12", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 46, "verse": 12}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["עִמָּנוּאֵל", "׳", "י", "עִמָּנוּ אֵל", "עִם"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Baer", "Gi", "van d.H."]}, "covers": ["H6005", "H410", "H5973"], "bdbid": "BDB6146", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}